# Deny-by-default. The Cloudflare Worker serves the repo root
# (wrangler assets.directory="."), so ANYTHING committed here is
# publicly readable on turningpointstudio.net. Only website files
# are allowed below; all internal docs/financials stay private.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/index.html
!/community.html
!/catalog.html
!/site.css
!/brand/
!/brand/**
!/sku/
!/sku/**
